<%- count = finding.advisories.size == 1 ? 'an advisory' : "#{finding.advisories.size} advisories" -%>
<%- if finding.fixable? -%>
`<%= finding.package %>` is pinned at <%= finding.pinned %>, which is affected by <%= count %>; upgrading to <%= finding.fix_version %> fixes <%= finding.advisories.size == 1 ? 'it' : 'all of them' %>.
<%- else -%>
`<%= finding.package %>` is pinned at <%= finding.pinned %>, which is affected by <%= count %>; no fixed release exists yet.
<%- end -%>

The remediation window is <%= days %> days for <%= finding.severity %> findings, per SECURITY-SLA.md.

## Advisories

<%- finding.advisories.each do |ghsa_id| -%>
- <%= ghsa_id %><%= finding.cve_ids[ghsa_id] ? " (#{finding.cve_ids[ghsa_id]})" : '' %>: <%= finding.advisory_summaries[ghsa_id] %>
<%- end -%>

```yaml
package: <%= finding.package %>
pinned: "<%= finding.pinned %>"
fix_version: <%= finding.fixable? ? %("#{finding.fix_version}") : 'null' %>
advisories:
<%- finding.advisories.each do |ghsa_id| -%>
  - <%= ghsa_id %>
<%- end -%>
severity: <%= finding.severity %>
source: <%= finding.source %>
```
